# CI and release workflow checks (cas-b5cd). Workers cannot push edits under
# .github/workflows/ (the token has no workflow scope), so each workflow job's
# gate declaration lives here, naming its workflow file and job. cas-cli/build.rs
# scans this file like any other check site.

# gate[C-01 ci]: Classify CI diff (class, rust-unaffected, web, journeys, bridge, script tests) (.github/workflows/ci.yml job ci-diff)
# gate[C-03 ci]: Docs Lint (fast rows, markdownlint, release-note drafts, instruction-file size) (.github/workflows/ci.yml job docs-lint)
# gate[C-04 ci]: Merge-queue runner route (self-hosted vs hosted) (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-runner-route)
# gate[C-08 ci]: Main-push and queue tree dedupe with full-gate receipt reuse (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-main-push-dedupe)
# gate[C-05 ci]: Scoped Validation (fast): script suites, fast rows, web/bridge, scoped nextest (.github/workflows/ci.yml job scoped-validation-fast)
# gate[C-06 ci]: Scoped Validation (factory/PR): fast rows, installer fixtures, web, scoped nextest (.github/workflows/ci.yml job scoped-validation)
# gate[C-09 ci]: Fast Validation preflight: cargo check, ISA test, debug build, CLI smoke (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-preflight)
# gate[C-10 ci]: CI tiers: script-suite tests and release publication guards (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-ci-tiers)
# gate[C-11 ci]: Slack bridge build and test (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-slack-bridge)
# gate[C-12 ci]: Commander web: typecheck, vitest, build, committed-dist drift, visual QA (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-web)
# gate[C-13 ci]: Commander journeys (6 hosted shards) (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-journeys)
# gate[C-14 ci]: Suite archive build (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-suite-build)
# gate[C-15 ci]: Rust archive dependency cache (main maintenance) (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-suite-cache)
# gate[C-16 ci]: Suite shards 1-3 (full product suite) and MCP store-untouched check (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-suite-shards)
# gate[C-17 ci]: Queue flake publication (.github/workflows/ci.yml job queue-flake-publication)
# gate[C-18 ci]: Full-suite fan-in (zero-test guard) (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-suite)
# gate[C-19 ci]: Doctests (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation-docs)
# gate[C-20 ci]: Fast Validation required fan-in and cas/full-gate status (.github/workflows/ci.yml job fast-validation)
# gate[C-21 ci]: Clippy (advisory) (.github/workflows/ci.yml job clippy)
# gate[C-22 ci]: macOS Check (.github/workflows/ci.yml job macos-check)
# gate[C-23 ci]: Test Compile Guard, panic isolation and build benchmark (.github/workflows/ci.yml job test-compile-guard)
# gate[C-30 release]: Install-path proof (macOS and clean Linux) (.github/workflows/install-path-proof.yml job macos)
# gate[C-02 ci]: Lane classify and no-build fast rows (.github/workflows/lane.yml job ci-diff)
# gate[C-33 ci]: Merge-queue watchdog and stale queued-run watchdog (.github/workflows/merge-queue-watchdog.yml job cancel-stale-merge-group-runs)
# gate[C-24 release]: Release prebuild Linux (.github/workflows/release-prebuild.yml job build)
# gate[C-25 release]: Release prebuild macOS ARM64 (.github/workflows/release-prebuild.yml job build-macos)
# gate[C-26 release]: Detect release version change on main push (.github/workflows/release.yml job detect)
# gate[C-27 release]: Look up prebuilt release assets with fallback build (.github/workflows/release.yml job lookup-linux)
# gate[C-28 release]: Packaged-asset ISA audit, signature check and launch smoke (.github/workflows/release.yml job audit-linux)
# gate[C-29 release]: Create Release (tag, notes, PR-opened timer) (.github/workflows/release.yml job release)
# gate[C-31 release]: Deploy Commander to the hosted hub (.github/workflows/release.yml job deploy-hub)
